  "question": {
    "text": "For the reaction at $298 \\mathrm{~K}, 2 \\mathrm{~A}+\\mathrm{B} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{C} . \\Delta \\mathrm{H}$ $=400 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$ and $\\Delta \\mathrm{S}=0.2 \\mathrm{~kJ} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1} \\mathrm{~K}^{-1}$. The reaction will become spontaneous above $\\qquad$ K.",
    "image": null
