  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\Delta \\mathrm{G}=0 \\\\ & \\mathrm{~T}=\\frac{\\Delta \\mathrm{H}}{\\Delta \\mathrm{S}}=\\frac{400}{0.2}=2000 \\mathrm{~K}\\end{aligned}$",
